---
description: Build tooling (esbuild + tsc + API Extractor; no Vite or Pentatrion here)
globs:
  - "tooling/**/*"
  - "packages/*/tsconfig*.json"
  - "tsconfig.base.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

- `tooling/build.mjs` builds with esbuild, emits declarations with tsc and rolls them up with API Extractor.
- `tooling/pack-check.mjs` checks the packed tarballs (publint, attw, contents); keep `files` in each `package.json` minimal.
- Builds must stay reproducible (CI builds twice and compares the bytes).
